{"parentUuid":"c1199be3-79af-44ab-b1dd-ab5775e247ad","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/fanshengxia/Desktop/AI","sessionId":"3715fbc2-be52-4df6-a942-726bd9b3fd57","version":"2.1.63","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"cryptic-churning-lantern","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0163eHJnoBeRG16HawaMfR2k","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"NVIDIA Q4 FY2026 earnings call transcript guidance 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"NVIDIA (NVDA) Q4 2026 Earnings Call Transcript | The Motley Fool\",\"url\":\"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/nvidia-nvda-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA Corporation (NVDA) Q4 FY2026 earnings call transcript\",\"url\":\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA/earnings/NVDA-Q4-2026-earnings_call-409967.html\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA Announces Financial Results for Fourth Quarter and Fiscal 2026 | NVIDIA Newsroom\",\"url\":\"https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-announces-financial-results-for-fourth-quarter-and-fiscal-2026\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA Corporation (NVDA) Q4 2026 Earnings Call Transcript | Seeking Alpha\",\"url\":\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4874926-nvidia-corporation-nvda-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA Corporation (NVDA) Stock Earnings Call Transcripts - Yahoo Finance\",\"url\":\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA/earnings-calls/\"},{\"title\":\"Earnings call transcript: NVIDIA Q4 2026 beats expectations, stock rises By Investing.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.investing.com/news/transcripts/earnings-call-transcript-nvidia-q4-2026-beats-expectations-stock-rises-93CH-4526215\"},{\"title\":\"Nvidia (NVDA) earnings report Q4 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/02/25/nvidia-nvda-earnings-report-q4-2026.html\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA CORP (NVDA.MX) Q4 FY2026 earnings call transcript\",\"url\":\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA.MX/earnings/NVDA.MX-Q4-2026-earnings_call-409967.html\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA CORP. R (NVD.DE) Q4 FY2026 earnings call transcript\",\"url\":\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVD.DE/earnings/NVD.DE-Q4-2026-earnings_call-409967.html\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA (NVDA) Q4 2026 Earnings Call Transcript - The Globe and Mail\",\"url\":\"https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/NVDA/pressreleases/428425/nvidia-nvda-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/\"}]\n\nI've found the NVIDIA Q4 FY2026 earnings call transcript and guidance information. Here are the key highlights:\n\n## Q4 FY2026 Earnings Results\n\nTotal revenue was $68 billion, up 73% year over year, with sequential acceleration from Q3. Data Center revenue was $62 billion, up 75% year over year and 22% sequentially, fueled by demand for Blackwell and Blackwell Ultra systems.\n\nNetworking revenue was $11 billion for the quarter, over 3.5x year over year, with full-year Networking exceeding $31 billion, up more than 10x versus fiscal 2021.\n\nSovereign AI revenue exceeded $30 billion for the year, more than tripling, primarily from Canada, France, the Netherlands, Singapore, and the UK.\n\n## Cash Flow & Shareholder Returns\n\nNVIDIA generated free cash flow of $35 billion in Q4 and $97 billion in fiscal year 2026. For the year, NVIDIA returned $41 billion, or 43% of free cash flow, to shareholders in the form of share repurchases and dividends.\n\n## 2026 Guidance\n\nManagement guided for Q1 revenue of $78B (±2%) and expects sustained sequential growth through 2026, underpinned by strong AI adoption, new product ramps, and robust customer commitments. NVIDIA is not assuming any data center revenue from China in its forecast.\n\nThe earnings call took place on February 25, 2026, with Jensen Huang (CEO) and Colette Kress (CFO) presenting results.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"dbb3bd86-e4cb-4374-b51a-95ed8a0a3df0","timestamp":"2026-03-02T06:32:53.100Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"NVIDIA Q4 FY2026 earnings call transcript guidance 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01S7GTWEZ7VRGASrqEtxbjqP","content":[{"title":"NVIDIA (NVDA) Q4 2026 Earnings Call Transcript | The Motley Fool","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/nvidia-nvda-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"title":"NVIDIA Corporation (NVDA) Q4 FY2026 earnings call transcript","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA/earnings/NVDA-Q4-2026-earnings_call-409967.html"},{"title":"NVIDIA Announces Financial Results for Fourth Quarter and Fiscal 2026 | NVIDIA Newsroom","url":"https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-announces-financial-results-for-fourth-quarter-and-fiscal-2026"},{"title":"NVIDIA Corporation (NVDA) Q4 2026 Earnings Call Transcript | Seeking Alpha","url":"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4874926-nvidia-corporation-nvda-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript"},{"title":"NVIDIA Corporation (NVDA) Stock Earnings Call Transcripts - Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA/earnings-calls/"},{"title":"Earnings call transcript: NVIDIA Q4 2026 beats expectations, stock rises By Investing.com","url":"https://www.investing.com/news/transcripts/earnings-call-transcript-nvidia-q4-2026-beats-expectations-stock-rises-93CH-4526215"},{"title":"Nvidia (NVDA) earnings report Q4 2026","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/02/25/nvidia-nvda-earnings-report-q4-2026.html"},{"title":"NVIDIA CORP (NVDA.MX) Q4 FY2026 earnings call transcript","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA.MX/earnings/NVDA.MX-Q4-2026-earnings_call-409967.html"},{"title":"NVIDIA CORP. R (NVD.DE) Q4 FY2026 earnings call transcript","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVD.DE/earnings/NVD.DE-Q4-2026-earnings_call-409967.html"},{"title":"NVIDIA (NVDA) Q4 2026 Earnings Call Transcript - The Globe and Mail","url":"https://www.theglobeandmail.com/investing/markets/stocks/NVDA/pressreleases/428425/nvidia-nvda-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}]},"I've found the NVIDIA Q4 FY2026 earnings call transcript and guidance information. Here are the key highlights:\n\n## Q4 FY2026 Earnings Results\n\nTotal revenue was $68 billion, up 73% year over year, with sequential acceleration from Q3. Data Center revenue was $62 billion, up 75% year over year and 22% sequentially, fueled by demand for Blackwell and Blackwell Ultra systems.\n\nNetworking revenue was $11 billion for the quarter, over 3.5x year over year, with full-year Networking exceeding $31 billion, up more than 10x versus fiscal 2021.\n\nSovereign AI revenue exceeded $30 billion for the year, more than tripling, primarily from Canada, France, the Netherlands, Singapore, and the UK.\n\n## Cash Flow & Shareholder Returns\n\nNVIDIA generated free cash flow of $35 billion in Q4 and $97 billion in fiscal year 2026. For the year, NVIDIA returned $41 billion, or 43% of free cash flow, to shareholders in the form of share repurchases and dividends.\n\n## 2026 Guidance\n\nManagement guided for Q1 revenue of $78B (±2%) and expects sustained sequential growth through 2026, underpinned by strong AI adoption, new product ramps, and robust customer commitments. NVIDIA is not assuming any data center revenue from China in its forecast.\n\nThe earnings call took place on February 25, 2026, with Jensen Huang (CEO) and Colette Kress (CFO) presenting results."],"durationSeconds":6.590046999999962},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c1199be3-79af-44ab-b1dd-ab5775e247ad"}
{"parentUuid":"a2807eea-aa7e-446e-b208-d5e546a7a4ac","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/fanshengxia/Desktop/AI","sessionId":"3715fbc2-be52-4df6-a942-726bd9b3fd57","version":"2.1.63","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"cryptic-churning-lantern","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017Ly1ZMsMXaBASxF7vJ8iwH","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"NVIDIA FY2026 Q4 earnings results revenue February 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Nvidia (NVDA) earnings report Q4 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/02/25/nvidia-nvda-earnings-report-q4-2026.html\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA Announces Financial Results for Fourth Quarter and Fiscal 2026 | NVIDIA Newsroom\",\"url\":\"https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-announces-financial-results-for-fourth-quarter-and-fiscal-2026\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA Corporation - NVIDIA 4th Quarter FY26 Financial Results\",\"url\":\"https://investor.nvidia.com/events-and-presentations/events-and-presentations/event-details/2026/NVIDIA-4th-Quarter-FY26-Financial-Results-2026-sO6kGS3C2P/default.aspx\"},{\"title\":\"Nvidia Earnings: Updates and Commentary February 2026 | Kiplinger\",\"url\":\"https://www.kiplinger.com/investing/live/nvidia-earnings-live-updates-and-commentary-february-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Nvidia Q4 Earnings Beat Expectations but Stock Plunges 5.5%, $260 Billion in Market Value Erased Overnight, Why Are Investors Voting With Their Feet?\",\"url\":\"https://www.tradingkey.com/analysis/stocks/us-stocks/261628049-nvidia-nvda-earnings-q4-stock-price-investors-value-tradingkey\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA Q4 revenue hits $68.1B on record FY 2026 | NVDA Stock News\",\"url\":\"https://www.stocktitan.net/news/NVDA/nvidia-announces-financial-results-for-fourth-quarter-and-fiscal-j0kg9vc0geqr.html\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA Q4 2026 Earnings Preview | Leverage Shares\",\"url\":\"https://leverageshares.com/en-eu/insights/nvidia-q4-2026-earnings-preview/\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA Reports Q4'FY2026 Earnings: Data Center and ProViz Drive Revenue Records - ServeTheHome\",\"url\":\"https://www.servethehome.com/nvidia-reports-q4-fy2026-earnings-data-center-and-proviz-drive-revenue-records/\"},{\"title\":\"Nvidia earnings preview: Q4 2026 | S&P Global\",\"url\":\"https://www.spglobal.com/market-intelligence/en/news-insights/research/2026/02/nvidia-earnings-preview-q4-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Nvidia smashes Q4 2026 with $68 billion in revenue, and a Q1 outlook that quashes AI bubble talk | Fortune\",\"url\":\"https://fortune.com/2026/02/25/nvidia-nvda-earnings-q4-results-jensen-huang/\"}]\n\nI found the NVIDIA FY2026 Q4 earnings results from February 2026. Here's a summary of the key findings:\n\n## Revenue Results\n\nNVIDIA reported record revenue for the fourth quarter ended January 25, 2026, of $68.1 billion, up 20% from the previous quarter and up 73% from a year ago. For fiscal 2026, revenue was $215.9 billion, up 65% from a year ago.\n\n## Data Center Performance\n\nRevenue in the data center business climbed 75% from a year earlier to $62.3 billion. The company now gets over 91% of sales from its data center unit, which houses its market leading artificial intelligence chips.\n\n## Earnings Per Share\n\nFor the quarter, GAAP and non-GAAP earnings per diluted share were $1.76 and $1.62, respectively.\n\n## Forward Guidance\n\nNVIDIA's outlook for the first quarter of fiscal 2027 is as follows: Revenue is expected to be $78.0 billion, plus or minus 2%. NVIDIA said it's not assuming data center revenue from China in its forecast.\n\n## Other Business Segments\n\nFor its professional visualization business, NVIDIA reported revenue of $1.32 billion for the quarter, up 159% year over year and ahead of expectations for $755.4 million, according to StreetAccount.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"1e7b4ca9-08d1-42da-86d1-42cc89c782e2","timestamp":"2026-03-02T06:33:03.964Z","toolUse