{"parentUuid":"49d90a5b-c71d-4184-8e7f-738829bb2b76","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/fanshengxia/Desktop/AI","sessionId":"3715fbc2-be52-4df6-a942-726bd9b3fd57","version":"2.1.63","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"cryptic-churning-lantern","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EheHtYyYWKrZfY9phPrXFH","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"NVIDIA NVDA ROE return on equity 2024 2025 2026 history\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"NVDA (NVIDIA) ROE % : 116.55% (As of Oct. 2025)\",\"url\":\"https://www.gurufocus.com/term/roe/NVDA\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA (NVDA) Return on Equity (ROE) - Current & Historical Data (Feb 2026)\",\"url\":\"https://www.financecharts.com/stocks/NVDA/growth/roe\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA ROE - Return on Equity 2012-2025 | NVDA\",\"url\":\"https://www.macrotrends.net/stocks/charts/NVDA/nvidia/roe\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA Corporation - ROE\",\"url\":\"https://www.wisesheets.io/roe/NVDA\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA ROE (Return on Equity) | NVIDIA Corp (NVDA)\",\"url\":\"https://valueinvesting.io/NVDA/metric/roe\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA Corporation ROE | NVDA\",\"url\":\"https://mlq.ai/stocks/NVDA/return-on-equity/\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA (NVDA) Statistics & Valuation\",\"url\":\"https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/nvda/statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA Corporation (NASDAQGS:NVDA) Return on Common Equity - Investing.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.investing.com/pro/NASDAQGS:NVDA/explorer/roe\"},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA (NVDA) Total Return YTD, TTM, 3Y, 5Y, 10Y, 20Y\",\"url\":\"https://www.financecharts.com/stocks/NVDA/performance/total-return\"},{\"title\":\"What is NVIDIA Return On Equity? NVDA | Macroaxis\",\"url\":\"https://www.macroaxis.com/invest/ratio/NVDA/Return-On-Equity\"}]\n\nBased on the web search results, here's NVIDIA's ROE (Return on Equity) information for 2024-2026:\n\n## Current ROE (2026)\nNVIDIA's ROE as of February 04, 2026 is 116.55%, though some sources report slightly different figures 