{"parentUuid":"3c985407-0995-4589-ac29-6c4bed8609be","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/fanshengxia/Desktop/AI","sessionId":"3715fbc2-be52-4df6-a942-726bd9b3fd57","version":"2.1.63","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"cryptic-churning-lantern","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01QsY9QBaWt9D8zm67ZBxrvk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PsUAtziJaoeDvzxnccQpmR","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport re\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import A4\nfrom reportlab.lib.units import mm\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import ParagraphStyle\nfrom reportlab.lib.enums import TA_LEFT\nfrom reportlab.lib import colors\nfrom reportlab.platypus import (SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer,\n                                  Table, TableStyle, HRFlowable,\n                                  KeepTogether, Preformatted)\nfrom reportlab.pdfbase import pdfmetrics\nfrom reportlab.pdfbase.cidfonts import UnicodeCIDFont\n\n# STSong-Light 是中文宋体，用于正文和标题（Bold 用加粗处理）\npdfmetrics.registerFont(UnicodeCIDFont('STSong-Light'))\n\nFONT = 'STSong-Light'\nC_DARK  = colors.HexColor('#0f3460')\nC_MID   = colors.HexColor('#16213e')\nC_LIGHT = colors.HexColor('#ccd6f6')\nC_BG    = colors.HexColor('#f0f4ff')\nC_WHITE = colors.white\nC_GRAY  = colors.HexColor('#888888')\nC_TH_BG = colors.HexColor('#0f3460')\nC_ALT   = colors.HexColor('#f8faff')\nC_CODE  = colors.HexColor('#f1f5f9')\nC_PRE   = colors.HexColor('#1e293b')\n\nS = {\n    'h1': ParagraphStyle('h1', fontName=FONT, fontSize=16, leading=21, textColor=C_DARK,\n                          spaceBefore=18, spaceAfter=4, bold=True),\n    'h2': ParagraphStyle('h2', fontName=FONT, fontSize=12.5, leading=17, textColor=C_MID,\n                          spaceBefore=14, spaceAfter=3, backColor=C_BG, borderPadding=5),\n    'h3': ParagraphStyle('h3', fontName=FONT, fontSize=11, leading=15, textColor=C_DARK,\n                          spaceBefore=10, spaceAfter=2),\n    'h4': ParagraphStyle('h4', fontName=FONT, fontSize=10, leading=14, textColor=C_MID,\n                          spaceBefore=7, spaceAfter=2),\n    'body': ParagraphStyle('body', fontName=FONT, fontSize=9.5, leading=15,\n                            textColor=colors.HexColor('#1a1a2e'), spaceBefore=2, spaceAfter=2),\n    'blockquote': ParagraphStyle('bq', fontName=FONT, fontSize=9, leading=14,\n                                  textColor=colors.HexColor('#555555'),\n                                  leftIndent=14, backColor=colors.HexColor('#fff8e1'),\n                                  borderPadding=7, spaceBefore=5, spaceAfter=5),\n    'pre': ParagraphStyle('pre', fontName='Courier', fontSize=7.5, leading=11,\n                           backColor=C_PRE, textColor=colors.HexColor('#e2e8f0'),\n                           leftIndent=8, rightIndent=8, spaceBefore=5, spaceAfter=5),\n    'tbl_hdr': ParagraphStyle('thdr', fontName=FONT, fontSize=8.5, leading=12, textColor=C_WHITE),\n    'tbl_cell': ParagraphStyle('tc', fontName=FONT, fontSize=8.5, leading=12, textColor=colors.HexColor('#1a1a2e')),\n}\n\ndef make_table(header, rows):\n    page_w = A4[0] - 28*mm\n    col_n = max(len(header), 1)\n    col_w = [page_w / col_n] * col_n\n    def h(t): return Paragraph('<b>' + str(t) + '</b>', S['tbl_hdr'])\n    def c(t): return Paragraph(parse_inline(str(t)), S['tbl_cell'])\n    data = [[h(x) for x in header]] + [[c(x) for x in row] for row in rows]\n    ts = TableStyle([\n        ('BACKGROUND', (0,0), (-1,0), C_TH_BG),\n        ('ROWBACKGROUNDS', (0,1), (-1,-1), [C_WHITE, C_ALT]),\n        ('GRID', (0,0), (-1,-1), 0.4, C_LIGHT),\n        ('VALIGN', (0,0), (-1,-1), 'TOP'),\n        ('TOPPADDING', (0,0), (-1,-1), 4),\n        ('BOTTOMPADDING', (0,0), (-1,-1), 4),\n        ('LEFTPADDING', (0,0), (-1,-1), 5),\n        ('RIGHTPADDING', (0,0), (-1,-1), 5),\n    ])\n    return KeepTogether([Table(data, colWidths=col_w, repeatRows=1, style=ts), Spacer(1,3)])\n\ndef parse_inline(text):\n    text = re.sub(r'\\*\\*(.+?)\\*\\*', r'<b>\\1</b>', text)\n    text = re.sub(r'`(.+?)`', r'<font name=\"Courier\" size=\"8\" color=\"#c0392b\">\\1</font>', text)\n    text = re.sub(r'\\*(.+?)\\*', r'<i>\\1</i>', text)\n    text = re.sub(r'\\[([^\\]]+)\\]\\([^\\)]+\\)', r'\\1', text)\n    # 转义 & 为 HTML entity\n    text = text.replace('&', '&amp;')\n    # 但不要双重转义\n    text = text.replace('&amp;amp;', '&amp;')\n    return text\n\ndef md_to_flowables(md_text):\n    flowables = []\n    lines = md_text.split('\\n')\n    i = 0\n    while i < len(lines):\n        line = lines[i]\n        raw = line.rstrip()\n\n        if raw.startswith('# ') and not raw.startswith('## '):\n            flowables.append(Paragraph('<b>' + parse_inline(raw[2:]) + '</b>', S['h1']))\n            flowables.append(HRFlowable(width='100%', thickness=2, color=C_MID, spaceAfter=4))\n            i += 1; continue\n        if raw.startswith('## ') and not raw.startswith('### '):\n            flowables.append(Paragraph('<b>' + parse_inline(raw[3:]) + '</b>', S['h2']))\n            i += 1; continue\n        if raw.startswith('### ') and not raw.startswith('#### '):\n            flowables.append(Paragraph('<b>' + parse_inline(raw[4:]) + '</b>', S['h3']))\n            flowables.append(HRFlowable(width='100%', thickness=0.5, color=C_LIGHT, spaceAfter=2))\n            i += 1; continue\n        if raw.startswith('#### '):\n            flowables.append(Paragraph('<b>' + parse_inline(raw[5:]) + '</b>', S['h4']))\n            i += 1; continue\n        if raw.strip().replace('-','') == '' and len(raw.strip()) >= 3 and '|' not in raw:\n            flowables.append(HRFlowable(width='100%', thickness=1.2, color=C_LIGHT, spaceBefore=6, spaceAfter=6))\n            i += 1; continue\n        if raw.startswith('```'):\n            code_lines = []\n            i += 1\n            while i < len(lines) and not lines[i].rstrip().startswith('```'):\n                code_lines.append(lines[i])\n                i += 1\n            i += 1\n            flowables.append(Preformatted('\\n'.join(code_lines), S['pre'], maxLineLength=100))\n            continue\n        if '|' in raw and raw.strip().startswith('|'):\n            tbl_lines = []\n            while i < len(lines) and '|' in lines[i] and lines[i].strip():\n                tbl_lines.append(lines[i].strip())\n                i += 1\n            data_rows = [r for r in tbl_lines if not re.match(r'^\\|[\\s\\-:|]+\\|$', r)]\n            if data_rows:\n                def pr(r): return [c.strip() for c in r.strip('|').split('|')]\n                header = pr(data_rows[0])\n                rows = [pr(r) for r in data_rows[1:]]\n                flowables.append(make_table(header, rows))\n            continue\n        if raw.startswith('> '):\n            bq = []\n            while i < len(lines) and lines[i].startswith('> '):\n                bq.append(lines[i][2:])\n                i += 1\n            flowables.append(Paragraph(parse_inline(' '.join(bq)), S['blockquote']))\n            continue\n        if re.match(r'^[\\*\\-] ', raw):\n            while i < len(lines) and re.match(r'^[\\*\\-] ', lines[i].rstrip()):\n                flowables.append(Paragraph('• ' + parse_inline(lines[i].rstrip()[2:]), S['body']))\n                i += 1\n            continue\n        if re.match(r'^\\d+\\. ', raw):\n            while i < len(lines) and re.match(r'^\\d+\\. ', lines[i].rstrip()):\n                m = re.match(r'^(\\d+)\\. (.*)', lines[i].rstrip())\n                if m:\n                    flowables.append(Paragraph(m.group(1)+'. '+parse_inline(m.group(2)), S['body']))\n                i += 1\n            continue\n        if raw.strip() == '':\n            flowables.append(Spacer(1, 4))\n            i += 1; continue\n\n        flowables.append(Paragraph(parse_inline(raw), S['body']))\n        i += 1\n    return flowables\n\ndef on_page(canvas, doc):\n    canvas.saveState()\n    w, h = A4\n    canvas.setStrokeColor(C_DARK)\n    canvas.setLineWidth(1.5)\n    canvas.line(14*mm, h-13*mm, w-14*mm, h-13*mm)\n    canvas.setFont(FONT, 8)\n    canvas.setFillColor(C_GRAY)\n    canvas.drawString(14*mm, 9*mm, 'NVDA 深度分析报告 | 2026年3月')\n    canvas.drawRightString(w-14*mm, 9*mm, f'第 {doc.page} 页')\n    canvas.restoreState()\n\nwith open('/Users/fanshengxia/Desktop/NVDA_Analysis_2026Q4.md', 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    md_content = f.read()\n\noutput_path = '/Users/fanshengxia/Desktop/NVDA_Analysis_2026Q4.pdf'\ndoc = SimpleDocTemplate(\n    output_path, pagesize=A4,\n    leftMargin=14*mm, rightMargin=14*mm,\n    topMargin=20*mm, bottomMargin=18*mm,\n    title='NVIDIA FY2026 Q4 深度投资分析报告',\n    author='tech-earnings-deepdive + us-value-investing',\n)\nflowables = md_to_flowables(md_content)\ndoc.build(flowables, onFirstPage=on_page, onLaterPages=on_page)\n\nimport os\nsize = os.path.getsize(output_path)\nprint(f\"✅ PDF 生成成功：{output_path}\")\nprint(f\"   文件大小：{size/1024:.1f} KB\")\nPYEOF","description":"Generate PDF using STSong-Light CID font with reportlab","timeout":60000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":251,"cache_read_input_tokens":141448,"output_tokens":3194,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":251,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CYdrg51My7nDc6J79ZLR6","type":"assistant","uuid":"69fe3b1e-5169-4a33-994e-ed6459e70588","timestamp":"2026-03-02T07:27:39.470Z"}
